notes.notes:
Adjustments and fixes made to improve the game experience, especially in story mode.



- Screen Reader additions (in Tutorial, Tournament, Settings and popups);

- Gameplay bug fixes and adjustments (AI freezing, difficulty, AI variation);

- Settings screen adjustments (Button Remapping);

- UI navigation and control adjustments;

- UI and character animation adjustments;

- Game Localization adjustments and additions;

- Sound adjustments (default volume, video mixing and some game sounds);

- Subtitles and fixes in the video player;

- Fixes for game crashes and freezes;

- Steam Achievements fixes;
